  - print exactly one balanced marker pair on stdout using `---LARCH-SUMMARY-FINAL-BEGIN---` / `---LARCH-SUMMARY-FINAL-END---` and the file body (mirror `step-16-17.sh` `print_summary_markers` newline handling)
  - touch `$IMPLEMENT_TMPDIR/.step17-emitted` **before teardown** (wrapper-owned; orchestrator does not post-teardown tmpdir writes)
