  - `implement-finalize teardown`
- Relay teardown stdout tail records verbatim (`RENAME_BRANCH`, `RENAME_STATUS`, `ISSUE_URL`, `STASH_REF`, `SENTINEL_WRITTEN`, `FINALIZE_SUBCOMMAND`, `FINALIZE_WARNINGS`, etc.).

